[9370.757151, "o", "   217\t        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) V[i] = z[i] / beta;\r\n   218\t        for (int i = 0; i <= m; i++) g[i] = 0.0;\r\n   219\t        g[0] = beta;\r\n   220\t        memset(H, 0, (m + 1) * m * sizeof(double));\r\n   221\t\r\n   222\t        int kdim = 0;\r\n"]
